m/drive/folders/1ImntsAQiNAIVW3wuAt2SaaJrt033JL3k?usp=drive_link\n\n特征】Lune 是一名 17 岁的英国女孩。身高 168 厘米。她非常苗条。她的眼睛是纯白色的（如果难以描绘，淡灰色也可以）。她的职业是修女，在教堂工作。她的皮肤非常白，几乎呈病态。头发颜色代码为 #e6f7ff。她的刘海向两边梳（不是钝刘海）。白色睫毛。我还想加一个雪花纹身，从她的肩膀一直延伸到脖子。\n武器】一把复古风格的剪刀。\n性格】外表听话、文静，实际上冷漠中带着一丝叛逆和邪恶。\n元素】丝带、破碎的十字架、一些血迹、翅膀、蓝色鸢尾花\n最喜欢的动物】小羊\n\n如果你想要一首适合她的氛围的音乐，我认为中村遥和卢卡的《祈祷》能完美地捕捉到她的精神--宁静、细腻、忧郁。\n我希望这幅画的氛围是明亮而梦幻的。姿势、表情和服装完全取决于你。如果您接受我的委托，我将深感荣幸。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ImntsAQiNAIVW3wuAt2SaaJrt033JL3k?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@scoop9001/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9ce611fa/uploads/origins/f88c6fcd-7d25-482c-8161-d2d00728d993?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4c70f0af9b3eeacf581c0a73627c614b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9ce611fa/uploads/origins/f88c6fcd-7d25-482c-8161-d2d00728d993?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4c70f0af9b3eeacf581c0a73627c614b, https://si.imgix.net/9ce611fa/uploads/origins/f88c6fcd-7d25-482c-8161-d2d00728d993?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a2a9b4823a1593c96f2525c5bcd81f0b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9ce611fa/uploads/origins/f88c6fcd-7d25-482c-8161-d2d00728d993?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=879f37babb8abaa9b399111b4fdf7917 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@scoop9001/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a779199b/uploads/origins/5e83102c-74c4-401c-8f65-1bd896f46d4e?bg=%23fff&auto=for